(38, 58, NULL, '../uploads/1781174745_Screenshot 2026-06-11 at 03.45.40.png', 'Here is the Medical Report from PIMS, Islamabad.	\r\nPAKISTAN INSTITUTE OF MEDICAL SCIENCES	\r\nG-8/3, ISLAMAHAD	\r\nPh: 051-9260500, Fax: 051-9260724, Web: www.pims.gov.pk	\r\nDated: 15ª Oct, 2024	\r\nNo. F.1-2/2024(PS-ED)PIMS	\r\nSubject:	MEDICAL REPORT	\r\nReference to letter from Superintendent, Central Prisons, Rawalpindi bearing No.43028 dated	\r\n14.10.2024. Mr. Imran Ahmed Niazi, was examined in the Central Jail (Adyala Jail).	\r\nRawalpindi on 15.10.2024 at 16:30 hours. He was found to be active. He was afebrile with	\r\nnormal blood pressure, pulse & Spoz 96% at room air. His complaint was dyspepsia for the	\r\nlast 5 days for which he was already on PPIs. He has tinnitus for last few months for which	\r\nhe is already taking medications and there is no fresh complaints regarding his cars. He is	\r\notherwise fit & healthy and does not need any further medication at the moment.	\r\n1)	(Dr.	\r\nment of ENT	Physician	\r\n', NULL, 137, 912, '2026-06-11 03:45:50'),
(39, 58, NULL, '../uploads/1781174839_Screenshot 2026-06-11 at 03.47.14.png', 'Milera	\r\nIlera Cares	\r\n[Hospital Name & Address]	\r\n[Date]	\r\nPatient Name: John Doe	\r\nDate of Birth: 12-03-1985	\r\nHospital ID: 12345678	\r\nTo Whom It May Concern,	\r\nRe: Medical Report for John Doe	\r\nHistory:	\r\nMr. John Doe presented with complaints of lower back pain and fever for the past 3	\r\ndays.	\r\nExamination Findings:	\r\nOn examination, the patient was febrile with tenderness over the lumbar spine area.	\r\nInvestigations:	\r\nX-ray of the lumbar spine showed no fractures. Blood test revealed a mild infection.	\r\nDiagnosis:	\r\nAcute lumbar strain with underlying infection.	\r\nTreatment Given:	\r\nAntibiotics and pain management medications prescribed. Patient advised to rest.	\r\nRecommendations:	\r\nMr. Doe is advised to take 7 days\' sick leave starting from 10th December 2025 to 16th	\r\nDecember 2025.	\r\nSincerely,	\r\nDr. A.B. Yusuf	\r\nConsultant Physician	\r\nMDCN No: 987654321	\r\n[Doctor\'s Signature]	\r\n[Hospital Stamp]	\r\n', NULL, 125, 921, '2026-06-11 03:47:23'),
